# Node dependencies
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# Build artifacts (dist can be built via `npm run build`)
# Note: dist is included or excluded based on preference; standard source repo ignores dist/
# but if users want load unpacked without building, we can keep or ignore.
# Let's include dist or ignore? Standard npm is ignore dist or track build if release.
# Let's ignore dist or keep it? Wait! In Chrome extensions on GitHub, users without Node love to download a ready-to-load folder, or we can track dist. But node_modules is huge!
# Let's definitely ignore node_modules and temporary/system files.

# System files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.local

